dly anybody else came back for just  one last question your conversion what  did it leave you with what is there what  currently yeah just a vague feeling of  ility sness a vague feeling that I  should go someplace and undo it but  there is no mechanism for that  what I would like to just show you tell  you is just one other thing and that is  that during the same period  two years ago when I was down in the  chasm the feeling that overwhelmed me  was that there were people who only  lived in my memory that I was the only  link to the world for these poor people  the shortage of whom Nara and the  feeling was just so awful but what I did  was I called him my son I'm still in bed  then and I said what I want you to do is  hear about the shortcut of home in it so  that you will also remember him and I  told him about the shortcut of home in  it and my son said to me okay I will  remember
 

